    <node id="&quot;UNB&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The UnB (Universidade de Brasília) is a university that offers various academic programs, research opportunities, and support services for students."&lt;SEP&gt;"The UnB is a university mentioned as the institution offering courses and managing academic processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The UnB is the institution where students attend and receive their education."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is a Brazilian federal university."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is a higher education institution in Brazil."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is the primary organization mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The University of Brasilia (UNB) is the main organization mentioned in the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB (Universidade de Brasília) is a Brazilian public university mentioned as offering various courses and programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB (Universidade de Brasília) is a higher education institution providing information to new students."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is a university providing educational services and offering various courses."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is the Universidade de Brasília (University of Brasilia), which approved the Regulation on Graduation Internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is the Universidade de Brasília and appears to be a large institution overseeing various academic programs, including internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB is the Universidade de Brasília, the subject of the document and provides information about its rules, regulations, and procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"UnB stands for Universidade de Brasília, a university in Brazil."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-96a7086e478d3df01d362bce62a3701a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a5dd6915ab901bad633c800a1755091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c404738092a3fab90cd0e5ca0d0d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e957d2a51bfff9288b13b4427453063d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab673f3f31e4b6cfe2fab27d4c223fbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5bb0f4549b11ac50894507586c40c60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8737c0a41a63b20de6e94c4437660b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
