    <node id="&quot;SIGAA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"SIGAA is a digital system used by the UnB to manage student internships, including registration and tracking."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a platform or system used for accessing course information, including curriculum details, student records, and communication with the university."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a software system used by Universidade de Brasília (UnB) for managing academic processes, including internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a student portal system used by UNB for enrollment management."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used by students to access information and perform tasks related to their studies."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used by the Universidade de Brasília (UnB) to manage various academic activities, including internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used for administrative activities by students at UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is a system used for managing student records and processes at the UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is an electronic information system used by UnB to manage student data and provide access to various resources."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA is the UnB's student information system, used for managing student data and processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"SIGAA stands for Sistema Integrado de Gestão de Atividades Acadêmicas, and it's the UnB's online platform for managing academic activities."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8c59ac10b277f004755ca3a5a2e708dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49c404738092a3fab90cd0e5ca0d0d7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4710c9d0424f9ec55118db8522b9dad7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69065f8900adcc5c23cde0bc047686d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d75f7bf60eadf2224d1e18fa5fbaaef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ed024080994acf4b7f84fdfdadf700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ff63049ba3e98452d1c02711fe4da8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83d2c369f83394a2c0bfcf9c3a7857f1</data>
    </node>
