    <node id="&quot;ESTÁGIO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Estágio refers to an internship program offered by the Universidade de Brasília (UnB)."&lt;SEP&gt;"Estágio refers to internships or practical training experiences offered as part of the curriculum."&lt;SEP&gt;"Estágio refers to internships or practical training opportunities offered as part of a curriculum."</data>
