    <node id="&quot;PROFESSOR(A) ORIENTADOR(A)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Professor(a) Orientador(a) is a faculty member who guides and supervises students during their internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"An academic advisor provides guidance and support to students during their internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"Professor(a) Orientador(a) refers to a professor who acts as a guide and mentor for students participating in internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"Professor(a) orientador(a) is a university professor who provides academic guidance and approves the student's internship plan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The professor who guides and supervises students during their internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The professor(a) orientador(a) (academic advisor) reviews and approves the internship plan from an academic perspective."</data>
