      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The DAIA appears to be a branch of UnB responsible for student support and academic integration."&lt;SEP&gt;"The DAIA, part of UnB, is responsible for managing and coordinating student internships. The text provides details about its roles and procedures."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) is a part of the Universidade de Brasília (UnB) responsible for monitoring student progress and integration into academic life."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) is involved in student support and integration within the UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica (DAIA) works alongside CESG to support internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Diretoria de Acompanhamento e Integração Acadêmica is another department within UnB focused on supporting student integration."</data>
