    <node id="&quot;TERMO DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO (TCE)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"TCE is a commitment term for internship signed by both the student and the host organization."&lt;SEP&gt;"Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) is a legal document signed by the student, company, supervisor, and university professor outlining the terms of an internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TCE is a document that formalizes the agreement between the student, the company/institution, and the UnB for an internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TCE is a formal agreement outlining the terms and conditions of the internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Termo de Compromisso de Estágio (TCE) is a legally binding agreement signed by all parties involved in an internship."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is a commitment agreement signed by the student, supervisor, and company/institution involved in the internship."</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-048bc3dae71a6d58215d4e108c5d85c5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49fd5da657bdbf3b4c28d98b6599a846&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47cdf8c51a32308ea4b4699ed897edce&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19ba12cc91f6df25812c8d49583d1695</data>
    </node>
