      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is a higher education institution that manages and facilitates student internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is a higher education institution that offers undergraduate programs and oversees the internship process. It's mentioned as a key entity throughout the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is a university that offers undergraduate programs and manages the internship process for its students."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is a university that provides information about its student internship program."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília (UnB) is the institution providing and regulating student internships. "&lt;SEP&gt;"The Universidade de Brasília is the main institution mentioned in the text, responsible for educational programs."</data>
