    <node id="&quot;COORDENAÇÃO DE ESTÁGIOS (CESG)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The CESG is a specific unit within the DAIA dedicated to managing and coordinating internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CESG is responsible for managing and coordinating internships at the UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The CESG, within the DAIA, specifically focuses on internship coordination. It's responsible for guiding students through the process of registering for and managing internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios (CESG) is a department within the DAIA specifically responsible for managing internships at the UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios (CESG) is responsible for managing internship programs within the Universidade de Brasília (UnB)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Coordenação de Estágios is a specific division within DAIA responsible for managing internships."</data>
