      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The DEG is likely a department or administrative unit within UnB focused on undergraduate education."&lt;SEP&gt;"The DEG oversees undergraduate education at the UnB."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Decanato de Ensino de Graduação (DEG) is a part of the UnB responsible for undergraduate education, including internship programs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Decanato de Ensino de Graduação (DEG) is a part of the Universidade de Brasília (UnB) responsible for undergraduate education and coordinating internships."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Decanato de Ensino de Graduação is a department within UnB responsible for undergraduate education."</data>
