      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Coordenação de Estágios (CESG) manages and oversees the submission process for Relatórios Finais by students."</data>
      <data key="d5">"internship administration, reporting procedures"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LEI 11.788/2008&quot;" target="&quot;RELATÓRIO PERIÓDICO&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Lei 11.788/2008 mandates the submission of a Relatório Periódico every six months during internships."</data>
      <data key="d5">"legal requirement, reporting cycle"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;LEI 11.788/2008&quot;" target="&quot;RELATÓRIO FINAL&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The Lei 11.788/2008 requires the submission of a Relatório Final upon completion of an internship."</data>
      <data key="d5">"legal requirement, internship conclusion"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ac407f61310418797bb84a4df139e830</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;CESG&quot;" target="&quot;TERMOS DE COMPROMISSO DE ESTÁGIO (TCE)&quot;">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The CESG coordinates the use of TCEs for managing internships within UnB."|&lt;|"process oversight, internship coordination"</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-90c9b5d9dcc0ebcd94a23ecb667edc84</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;ESTÁGIO (INTERNSHIP)&quot;" target="&quot;TCE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"The TCE is required for the formalization of an estágio (internship)."</data>
      <data key="d5">"formal requirements, legal documentation"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE (STUDENT)&quot;" target="&quot;TCE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A discente (student) is required to sign the TCE as part of the internship agreement. "</data>
      <data key="d5">"participant involvement, legal obligation"</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-5a080acc0efc63e3b6d8a356d163a71d</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;PROFESSOR(A) ORIENTADOR(A)&quot;|&lt;|&quot;ADVISER-ADVISEE&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A professor(a) orientador(a) advises and guides a discente during their internship."|</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;REPRESENTANTE DA EMPRESA&quot;">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A discente works under the supervision of a representante da empresa during their internship at the company."|&lt;|"employer-employee"</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="&quot;DISCENTE&quot;" target="&quot;SUPERVISOR(A)&quot;|&lt;|&quot;SUPERVISEE-SUPERVISOR&quot;">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">"A supervisor(a) guides and oversees a discente's work during their internship."|</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e7a7f9dadf0f9739ca523954767c461f</data>
    </edge>
